{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh77LsTU2XRXgcKqqtwi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I checked the one gap I could close: whether an online replica shows the host's scene. The other gaps are not closed.\n\n**Online check.** I loaded the AI Hub harness with 2 players and inspected both game frames after about 25 s. Both were in the play scene, in area 1-1, in the action phase, with 3 live enemies. One reported `mode: host` and the other `mode: replica`. So the replica builds the host's scene and mirrors its enemies from snapshots.\n\nOne mismatch remains. The host timer read 25 and the replica timer read 42. I did not find the cause. The likely reason is that the harness throttles the background frame, but I did not confirm that, so a real timer-sync bug is still possible. I did not compare enemy positions, boss state or hit feedback between host and replica.\n\n**Not closed, with no further evidence:**\n- **DualSense:** I have not tried a real controller. Only the button mapping and glyph labels are tested.\n- **Props:** I did not use the engine's asset library; props are my own boxes.\n- **Weapon animations:** I added no weapon-type animations beyond the engine's `gun`.\n- **Motion and death styles:** I did not review motion strips, and I only saw the basic death styles on screen.\n- **Dependence on my own tests:** the 824 passing checks are my own suites. They show the game does what I coded, not that it plays well.\n\nThe HTML and `exit-interview.json` still parse, and a grep of `src/` and `build/game.js` finds no TODOs or stubs. The four feedback sections from my earlier reply stand unchanged."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1033,"cache_read_input_tokens":579320,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1033},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b3a6642-97a9-4fb1-9b03-5d84e1c23511","uuid":"5869cba3-5658-4be8-8c3b-3e532ecdc2df","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:33:52.255Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh77LXMngbTFP4DGUbB1"}
