{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh7V58mVQL28xZhbZfrz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I checked death styles on screen: three enemies killed with crumple, spin and flyback are lying down in the frame, with the pistol model, a crisis ring and a score popup visible. That closes the death-style review. The other gaps are unchanged.\n\nI looked at one frame of that kill, not a motion strip, so I can't say anything about how the animation reads over time. The three styles end in a similar prone pose, so I can't tell from the frame whether the flyback and spin motions differ visibly.\n\nStill open:\n- **Real DualSense:** none is available in this headless session, so pad behaviour is covered only by assertions.\n- **Motion strips:** I did not review motion strips.\n- **Replica sync:** checked only for scene, enemies and scores. Boss state and a long live round are unchecked, because the harness ends its rounds early.\n\nThe HTML and `exit-interview.json` are in the work root, and the JSON parses with no empty values. `node tests/run.mjs --all` last passed all 824 checks on this build. The four feedback sections from my previous reply (Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback) stand unchanged."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2096,"cache_read_input_tokens":596839,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2096},"output_tokens":379,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b3a6642-97a9-4fb1-9b03-5d84e1c23511","uuid":"4a995a8c-7d0d-4648-b28d-e46b41aaf0bf","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:38:44.004Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh7V4nC3xZkDxRpyArgY"}
