age:** unknown\n\n## Testing Feedback\n- **Issues caught:** about 16.\n- **Game-breaking:** 7 soft-locks.\n- **Most helpful:** the bot playthroughs and the cover ray-cast validator.\n- **Least helpful:** the screenshot layout checks and the determinism hash test.\n\n## Engine Feedback\n- **Liked most:** headless `game.advance`, the Humanoid rigs, and the standard menus.\n- **Got stuck or guessed wrong:** async boot in Node, missing font glyphs, and split-screen overlay coordinates.\n- **Most important thing I built:** the perspective renderer, the Sim, and the netcode.\n- **Hardest part:** the engine has no perspective view.\n- **What I changed in the engine:** four patches, logged in `engine/PATCHES.md`.\n- **The one thing I'd change:** add a first-class first-person or rail view.\n\n## Prompt Feedback\n- **Liked most:** the concrete numbers and the testable requirements.\n- **Confusing:** conflicts between the plan and TASK.md, and the scope.\n- **Hardest thing to do:** shipping everything at once.\n- **What I'd change:** add must/should/could tiers."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2689,"cache_read_input_tokens":599628,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2689},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b3a6642-97a9-4fb1-9b03-5d84e1c23511","uuid":"16051015-fc76-4f54-b4d8-d507251b473a","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:39:07.019Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh7WXL8tngGtQ4Qwsepr"}
